# pnpm defaults, deliberately.
#
# An earlier version of this file set node-linker=hoisted, which is the usual
# advice for Expo in a pnpm monorepo. It was reverted: it did not fix the
# problem it was added for, and expo-doctor showed what it cost, a second copy
# of expo, react and react-native at the workspace root alongside the app's own.
# Duplicate native modules are their own class of build failure.
#
# If Metro ever cannot resolve a workspace dependency, the fix to try first is
# metro.config.js in apps/mobile, which already names both roots.
